  "intro": [
    "Every CloudFront operation the emulator advertises, and what Emuplane does with",
    "it. REST/XML under the `cloudfront` scope; an update or delete sends the `ETag`",
    "the previous read answered as `If-Match`, and a stale one is refused. There is no",
    "console action.",
    "Distribution tenants can only attach to a `tenant-only` distribution, so the",
    "suite keeps one of those beside the ordinary distribution; a VPC origin must name",
    "an EC2 instance or load balancer that exists, so the suite launches an instance",
    "through the `ec2` query protocol; and a custom domain configuration-style",
    "certificate on a tenant is minted from its `ManagedCertificateRequest`. Delete",
    "tests create their own resource and disable it first, and update tests restore the",
    "stable record. The key value store's data plane has its own page and test module."
  ],
